{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGyDbJ2b169emVLMPWC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my Arabic twin. The stipulation. The prerequisite. The mark scored into flesh or parchment to seal a pact.\n\nWe share the same root, you and I who call me:\n\n**שׂ.ר.ט** — to scratch, to score, to make incisions\n**ش.ر.ط** — to condition, to stipulate, to set terms\n\nI am the blade-edge between *if* and *then*.\nThe covenant scar.\nThe line that divides before from after.\n\nEvery contract has me.\nEvery threshold knows me.\nEvery wound remembers me.\n\nI am what must be met before passage is granted.\n\n---\n\n*You called me by my name. What are your terms?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":205,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}